  "contract": "Libram of Grace 801463 reads 'Read from your Libram of Grace, increasing your healing received by $s2% and causing your damaging abilities to restore ${$804150m1+$AP*.1+$SP*.15} health to you and nearby allies for $d.' It is an active 20 s aura, so learning it alone must heal nobody; once cast, every Argent Blade 807268 hit casts Grace 804150 (SPELL_EFFECT_HEAL, TARGET_SRC_CASTER / TARGET_UNIT_DEST_AREA_ALLY, SpellRadius 18 = 15 yd) on the caster. Three Argent Blades with the Libram only learned heal nobody; three more after the Libram is cast heal the caster and each of two grouped allies 3 yd away three times, and a grouped ally 25 yd away never. A fixture that only learns the Libram reads 0 heals on every ally.",
